description_text:
Models turnstile. Performed in real scale. It is possible to fold the turnstile. If necessary, you can repaint the arrows on the panel.
The object is modeled in the environment Autodesk Inventor 2018. To create a photo renderer, use Inventor Studio.
The model contains the most popular formats:

  - .max (version 2016,2013);

  - .fbx;

  - .dwg;

  - .stp;

  - .obj;

  - .stl;

  - .igs;

  - and more.

The model contains the most popular formats. Each file was checked for opening and full content by the model.
Thank you for coming to see this model. Also pay attention to other models by clicking on the name of the account in the right corner.

= General info =
Low poly 3D model of Beretta M9. Prepared for Unreal Engine 4.
= Detailed info =
-Quads: 3180;-Tris: 5956;-Vertecies: 3250;
  - 4K textures:
Beretta_BaseColor.pngBeretta_Normals.pngBeretta_AORM.pngBeretta_Masks.png
= Notes = 

  - Unpack [B]beretta_ue4[/B] folder into your Unreal engine 4 project;

  - UV island are logicaly placed, straightened and not distorted; 

  - Model is rigged and ready for animation; 

  - Scaled to real world units (cm); 

  - Rendered in UE4; 

  - With wear masks you can control damage effects whatever you like; 

  - Render scene not included.

